{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1273875-the-story-told-podcast-w20-interview-with-matthew-dawkins","id":1273875,"title":"The Story Told Podcast - W20 Interview with Matthew Dawkins!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-11T06:13:13-08:00","id":1273875,"title":"The Story Told Podcast - W20 Interview with Matthew Dawkins!","content":"Good morning friends! I am Logan from The Story Told podcast (<a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com</a>, also on iTunes and Spotify!) and we are beginning the preliminary planning for an interview about the W20 development process with Matthew Dawkins. This episode will be part of a three to four episode arc featuring Wraith 20th anniversary exclusively! These episodes will include the aforementioned interview as well as an overview of the game, example of character creation, and an actual play episode featuring these characters run by our character artist Noah Hirka ( <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ichor.teeth/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.instagram.com/ichor.teeth/</a> and <a href=\"https://ichorteeth.artstation.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ichorteeth.artstation.com/</a> ). Here at The Story Told we really value you, the players and Storytellers of the games we love to play. To honor that we are reaching out to you here at the Onyx Path forums. Please reach out to us with with questions you have about W20 either here, Twitter (@StoryToldPod) or via email (<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"691d010c1a1d061b101d06050d19060d0a081a1d290e04080005470a0604\">[email&#160;protected]</a>)! Thank you and happy listening!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T21:22:18-08:00","id":1273992,"title":"","content":"Why hasn't the Hierarchy done anything about the concentration camps set up by the Giovanni?<br /> Will there be a Wraith 5th edition?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T07:41:37-08:00","id":1274200,"title":"","content":"What do you think the Wraith metaplot and setting should be going forward with Wr20/Wr5? Ends of Empire definitively ended Wraith and while it did have an opening for future stories they tore down setting as we knew it. Stygia's gone. Charon and the Deathlords are gone. Everything we knew is gone. While Orpheus did continue the setting, their vision of the Underworld is not perhaps suited for Wraith games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T09:59:16-08:00","id":1274211,"title":"","content":"There are some interesting changes in Wr20 that seem very deliberate and I'd love to hear the thoughts behind them. For instance, what was the thinking that went into the changes to Drones and Stygian Steel?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T12:07:24-08:00","id":1274230,"title":"","content":"...and I guess I'll ask what has been banded around here:<br /> <br /> What was the thinking behind making the rating 5 Arcanoi powers so different from their 1e-2e counterparts? Especially with the perception that Wr20 nerfed them unnecessarily?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-28T08:51:35-08:00","id":1283279,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hey there friends! Join us this episode where we team up with Matthew Dawkins (The Gentleman Gamer) to discuss his role as a developer for Wraith the Oblivion 20th anniversary edition. Fielding questions not only from our team here at the story told but also members of the Onyx Path forums we are excited to bring you this episode. Thanks to all who submitted questions to us including Noah Hirka our own resident artist here at The Story Told. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">You can follow Matthew on YouTube and social media:</span></span></span><ul><li>The Onyx Path YouTube channel: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzN5jRB35OvnC-6gxnRY4gQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzN...OvnC-6gxnRY4gQ</a></li> <li>The Gentleman Gamer: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/clackclickbang\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/user/clackclickbang</a></li> <li>Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/clackclickbang\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/clackclickbang</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Wraith 20th anniversery edition can be found at Drive thru RPG:</span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/233842/Wraith-The-Oblivion-20th-Anniversary-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/233842/Wraith-The-Oblivion-20th-Anniversary-Edition?src=hottest_filtere</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Be sure to check out the video game Grim Fanango:</span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.grimremaster